<component>
    <div display="flex" flex-direction="column" class="case-pane doc-pane">
        <h2>{t("case.counter.title")}</h2>

        <Card title="组件说明">
            <p>计数器案例演示 RML 的命令绑定与状态更新。通过 #[command] 方法处理点击事件，修改 pub 字段后框架自动触发重渲。</p>
            <p>核心概念：pub 字段是 observable，#[computed] 方法缓存计算结果，#[command] 方法处理事件并更新字段。</p>
        </Card>

        <Card title="API">
            <Table columns={api_columns} rows={api_rows} bordered="" stripe="" />
        </Card>

        <Card title="示例代码">
            <CodeEditor value={code_sample} />
        </Card>

        <Card title="演示效果">
            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>基础计数</h3>
                <p>{counter_text}</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Button label="点击 +1" primary="" on-click={on_click} />
                    <Button label="重置" ghost="" on-click={on_reset} />
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="demo-section">
                <h3>步长控制</h3>
                <p>当前步长：{step}（每次点击 +步长）</p>
                <div class="button-row">
                    <Button label="步长 +1" on-click={on_inc_step} />
                </div>
            </div>
        </Card>
    </div>
</component>
